# Flash (CR 702.8a): Bot1 casts The Unagi of Kyoshi Island ({3}{U}{U}, paid exactly by the Island and four Moxen: nothing is left in the pool) in response to Bot2's Brainstorm, on Bot2's turn.
# Bot2's turn draw was its first card of the turn and Brainstorm's draws start with its second, so the Unagi's trigger happens once, not for each of Brainstorm's three: Bot1 draws two
# cards, ending with its Brainstorm and those two. On Bot1's own turn its Brainstorm is a second draw too (after the draw step) but it is no opponent's: nothing is drawn for it.

